WEBVTT

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.330
Jeeves-<i>san</i>,

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:28.160
can I ask why Mariah-<i>san </i>would say what she did?

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.620
And why are you doing what she said to?

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:37.040
Kana, Yumemi, at present, you are
too unskilled to possess Artifacts.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:40.120
I need you to return the Artifacts
that are currently in your possession,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.540
then leave the mansion.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:47.160
Mariah-<i>sama </i>is acting under
orders from Morrigan-<i>sama</i>.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:53.410
With Maeve-<i>sama </i>absent,
it is my duty to follow her instructions.

00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:58.620
Oh, no! Jeeves-<i>san</i>, you would choose
Mariah-<i>san </i>over the rest of us?

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:02.250
To Jeeves-<i>san</i>, both Mariah-<i>sama </i>and Maeve-<i>sama</i>

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:06.790
are the children that he looked after.
It is not a question of choosing.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:11.790
If I may offer my opinion,
I believe that Mariah-<i>sama</i>

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:14.910
is doing what she is
with you mistresses in mind.

00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:16.870
But she told us to leave.

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:23.330
If that is what will prove best for
you mistresses, then I am fine with it.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:28.330
Doing so is out of consideration for you.

00:01:43.330 --> 00:01:46.410
<i>Tell me, do you remember?</i>

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:50.330
<i>Yes, the wondrous God-given power you have,</i>

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:56.200
<i>like sleight of hand without any tricks?</i>

00:01:56.200 --> 00:02:00.000
<i>Tell me, have you already forgotten?</i>

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.160
<i>Those dreamlike, heart-shaped</i>

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:08.540
<i>flower-bouquet-like words of yours?</i>

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:14.790
<i>I'm sure, I'm sure</i>

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:18.410
<i>this key will open your treasure box</i>

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:24.660
<i>and let you remember them tonight</i>

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.540
<i>Farewell!</i>

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:28.830
<i>Watch me now,</i>

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:32.040
<i>I'm gently, quietly going to disappear,</i>

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.000
<i>so find me</i>

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.200
<i>I'm over here</i>

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:40.330
<i>Our long, long night of secrets is beginning</i>

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.620
<i>Come after me</i>

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:46.790
<i>Once you see the twinkle of my tearstains,</i>

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:49.660
<i>catch me with your voice</i>

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:54.370
<i>and the magic words only the two of us know</i>

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:07.910
Stop! I'm placing the area ahead off limits!

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:11.200
Dina, I'm just here to tidy up the bedroom.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:14.790
Unnecessary. I will take care of the <i>sensei</i>.

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:15.660
Huh?

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:17.080
Why are you so surprised?

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.540
This is a basic application of magic.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:23.000
You're pretty bold to want to
be an apprentice at this level.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:31.080
The way things are headed, Mariah-<i>san</i>
is going to drive us out of the house.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:34.450
Maybe Mother can do something to help.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:36.080
But how do we reach her?

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:40.290
If we had an Artifact that could deliver
a message to her, like a carrier pigeon,

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:43.330
it could look for Mother and contact her.

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.700
Are you sure you can create an Artifact?

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:50.120
No, not really, but if I focus
my feelings, I think I can.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:03.450
Please, find Mother.

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.330
Nothing's happening, huh?

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:15.790
Maybe you really do have to be
a practical magician like Mother to do it.

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:20.830
Ah, you did it! It's moving, Yumemi!

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:32.580
O-Ow! That hurts! What's going on?!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.950
--Hey, knock it off! No!
--I guess that failed.

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:40.790
Ow! H-Hey, Yumemi, do something!

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:47.040
Looks like he's not around.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.700
I'm here to clean the room.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.040
Come on in.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:54.910
Pardon the intrusion.

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.540
Can you tell how that's done?

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:06.370
No, not in the least.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:08.250
Would you like to try?

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.330
Y-Yes!

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.290
Makoto, aren't you going to use <i>it</i>?

00:05:19.290 --> 00:05:20.410
"It"?

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:24.620
You aren't going to use an
Artifact's power, like Mamoru does?

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:27.540
I want to do this all on my own.

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.700
What are you doing?!

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:37.790
Sensei, why are you teaching Makoto anything?!

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:39.700
He isn't even your apprentice!

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:44.950
Take it easy. I wasn't teaching him.
I was only watching.

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.500
But...!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:56.330
This is simple magic.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:59.580
Just for the record, I do not
approve of you being an apprentice.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.910
Unless you can do at least
one magic trick that I can't,

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:05.410
then you aren't qualified.

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:07.950
A magic trick that you can't do?

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:11.160
And if I can do that, you'll accept me?

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:14.330
<i>If </i>you can do that, yes.

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:24.160
Oh, Master...

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.000
W-Welcome home.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.750
I heard what happened.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:32.160
You declared that you would do a
magic trick that Dina-<i>kun </i>couldn't beat.

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:33.830
Good luck with that.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.660
R-Right.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.620
Makoto-<i>sama</i>, Mamoru-<i>sama</i>,

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:41.330
Mariah-<i>sama </i>is waiting for
you in the reception room.

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:43.500
Father, explain.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:47.540
Why did you agree to let
Mariah-<i>san </i>live in the mansion?

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.450
Hmm, well, you see...

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:54.330
Why is the crest thief now
in control of the mansion?!

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:58.910
Mamoru-<i>san</i>, would you explain things to her?

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:03.370
Maeve told me that Mariah and
my master were here at the house...

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:07.120
You saw Mother?! Did you ask
her why she hasn't come home?

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:12.910
Oh, I did speak to her. But all she
said was that there was a situation.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.750
So you've finally come home,
you dumb apprentice!

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.250
Master Gregory!

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:21.120
What is the meaning of inviting
me here, then neglecting me?

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:25.370
Oh, I just barely got home. I'm so sorry.

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:28.000
Um, Sensei, could you introduce us?

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:33.660
Oh, yes, of course. I suppose Mamoru
here is your senior apprentice, after all.

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:39.040
This is Dina Camelot,
my star apprentice. Unlike you.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:43.750
I'm Hoshisato Mamoru.
Nice to meet you, Dina-<i>kun</i>.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:46.160
Pleased to meet you. I'm Dina.

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:50.950
I want to be just like you. I'm working
to be just as good as you are.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:53.950
I'm really not anything special, though.

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:58.200
Master, please come to the dining room.
You haven't eaten yet, have you?

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:01.790
Father! We're not finished
talking about this yet!

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:04.750
Mamoru-<i>sama </i>is exhausted from his long trip.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:09.000
Why don't you give him a
little time to rest up first?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:11.370
Sorry, my precious.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.750
Man!

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:22.040
I can't take any more! Not today!

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:25.580
Yumemi! We have no choice but
for you to use your Artifact now!

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:27.290
Artifact?

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:31.950
I actually made one to try to contact Mother,

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:34.160
but it didn't go so well.

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:36.660
But I <i>did </i>make a different kind--

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:41.000
an Artifact that attacks
anything near it if upset.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.500
Let's use it to drive Mariah-<i>san </i>out of here!

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.250
Wouldn't that be dangerous?

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:49.580
It's all right. We're just kicking her out
of the mansion and keeping her out.

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:53.120
But we need to test it.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:55.750
Make sure it actually activates.

00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:59.080
Link up, Omit Home.

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:05.040
Mm-hmm, it's connected.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:08.620
Amazing, Yumemi! That's my little sister!

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:18.290
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>, stop! Cancel the test!

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:21.200
I already have canceled it.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.950
How come...?

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:24.580
Get rid of it, Yumemi!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:27.290
It won't... leave my hand.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:28.700
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>!

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:43.080
Looks like they want to get
rid of me, whatever it takes.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:47.750
I am earnestly thinking
about their own happiness.

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:51.870
I know that. I'm grateful that you are, Mariah.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.450
What's that?

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:59.790
Uh-oh, it's out of control, and I can't stop it.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:02.250
If we don't do something, we'll be crushed!

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:05.450
Smile Stick, Vanishing Magic!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:08.540
I can't let go!

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:11.660
Big brother, it's too
dangerous to hold. Destroy it.

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:14.410
But you went to such trouble to make it.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:17.040
Makoto, hurry! We'll all be crushed!

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:21.540
All right. Gaugau, Muff-<i>kun</i>, protect them!

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:28.410
Muff-<i>kun</i>, Command... um,
oh, whatever! Guard Mode!

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:35.620
Makoto, do it now! Hurry!

00:10:35.620 --> 00:10:38.540
Come on! Come on!

00:10:54.410 --> 00:10:55.290
Makoto!

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:56.330
Big brother!

00:10:56.330 --> 00:11:00.080
Sorry. I guess my finesse needs more work.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.950
Oh, no! You're injured, Makoto!

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:06.950
I'm fine. It's just a little scratch.

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:11.700
I'm sorry. I got you hurt.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.040
Mistress!

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:16.160
Ema-<i>san</i>! It's all right! Nothing happened!

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:20.580
This doesn't look like nothing happened!
Not after you did all <i>this</i>!

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:25.700
A runaway Artifact.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.080
Jeeves, quite the screw-up.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.830
Yes, I am terribly sorry, Mariah-<i>sama</i>.

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.290
Someone even got hurt, too.

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:37.910
What would you have done
if it was worse than this?

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:40.250
Well, Mamoru-<i>san</i>?

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:41.700
I'm so sorry.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:44.250
Both of you, apologize!

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:46.750
I'm sorry.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:52.370
U-Um, this injury is all on me. Hatena and
Yumemi didn't do anything wrong.

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:55.330
It's not a question of that, Makoto-<i>kun</i>.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:59.250
I think it's best if the two of you
leave this house right away.

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:07.410
Father, why are you keeping quiet?
Why don't you say something?

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.450
Father...

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:13.580
I am acting on behalf of your
grandmother, the head of our family.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:17.620
You have no other choice but to do as I say.

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:19.290
If you continue to disobey me,

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:23.330
I will expel you before Gregory and Dina leave.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:32.160
Jeeves-<i>san</i>, Mamoru-<i>sama</i>,
is this really the way it must be?

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:35.120
Ema, you understand why, too.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.410
This isn't what I wanted, either.

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:41.790
Ah, yes,

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:45.120
about your new home...

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:47.870
Our home is right here.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:51.330
We are not about to accept being kicked out.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:56.120
Mamoru-<i>san </i>did not oppose me,

00:12:56.120 --> 00:13:00.370
and this morning, he left with
Gregory-<i>san </i>without saying a word.

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:03.120
Do you understand his sentiment?

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:09.830
Mamoru-<i>san </i>is worried!

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:13.540
There are many people out to
get Hoshisato family Artifacts!

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:14.830
Be reasonable.

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.040
No.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:19.950
Not very endearing.
Ema-<i>san</i>, say something, will you?

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:21.450
Thank you, no.

00:13:21.450 --> 00:13:24.620
Oh, are you reinforcing
the children's willfulness?

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:28.410
My job is to protect Kana-<i>sama </i>and Yumemi-<i>sama</i>.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:32.830
Not to worry; once the girls
are gone, I'm not going to fire you.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:37.790
It will not come to that.
When the mistresses leave the mansion,

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:41.790
it is my intention to leave with them.

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:46.660
When you leave, I will, of course,
be taking your Artifact, as well.

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:51.160
That maid uniform is quite
an exceptional Artifact, after all.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:54.750
This is my own personal property to begin with.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:58.000
There is no justification for
the village to take it from me.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:01.330
Huh? That isn't one of my sister's Artifacts?

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:06.910
Maeve-<i>sama </i>made it an Artifact,
but the maid uniform itself is mine.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:10.160
Oh, sister, this is such a hassle.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:15.290
Everyone is just doing
whatever Mariah-<i>san </i>tells them!

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.700
It sounds like a mess.

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.450
We can protect ourselves with our Artifacts.

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:20.620
Sure.

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:24.200
But Artifacts require contracts,

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:27.080
so even if anyone stole them,
they couldn't use them, could they?

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:31.870
Anyone can use an Artifact's
basic abilities without a contract.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.410
Oh, they can?

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:38.750
But to use its true power, you have
to enter into a contract with its real name.

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:43.500
And to break that contract,
the original owner has to order it,

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:45.830
or the owner has to be eliminated.

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:46.950
Eliminated?

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:50.040
There are those who would use such means.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:53.120
That's why they say it's dangerous.

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.660
But I can't just let this go
because of the danger.

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:59.330
Being the master thief Hatena is my dream.

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:04.000
I'm back!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.660
Welcome home, big brother.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:10.450
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>...?

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:13.830
A class at the pool?

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:17.910
I... can't swim.

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:21.950
But the rest of the class
is expecting it from me.

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:26.450
Oh, I see. They all think
that you can do anything,

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:29.700
so you don't want to betray their expectations.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:34.790
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>, let's practice and get
you swimming. I'll teach you how.

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:39.080
But I'm afraid of the water.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:43.700
Okay, forget practice. How about if
we all went out for some fun instead?

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.790
We have to get you
accustomed to the water first.

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:54.450
I wasn't expecting a pool this fancy.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.950
Word will get out if we go
to the local pool, right?

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:00.330
This is top-secret training.

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:02.450
This is a pretty nice place, isn't it?

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:05.660
For that matter, why are
you even here, Mariah-<i>san</i>?

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:08.500
I could use some time off, too.

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:13.080
I wanted to decline, but Mamoru-<i>sama </i>insisted.

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:15.660
Big brother, teach me.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:17.620
Mm-hmm, let's go.

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:23.450
Good. Just like that, Yumemi-<i>chan</i>.

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:24.450
Here,

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:27.290
there's nothing to be afraid of,
so just go under nice and easy.

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:47.120
Incredible! Yumemi-<i>chan</i>, you can do this!

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:55.040
If it's bothering you, just tell
them you want to get in, too.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:57.000
B-But...

00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:00.450
...to do that, I'd have to
get undressed, wouldn't I?

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.950
Go ahead and show off what you've got!

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:06.450
Then maybe Makoto-<i>kun </i>will take notice of you.

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:09.450
H-He doesn't need to take notice of me!

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:12.200
Oh, hey! Hatena!

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:14.370
Looks like he saw us.

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:22.450
It looks like those girls
have finally settled down.

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:25.450
That's not very friendly.

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:29.370
Do you have to chase them out, no matter what?

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:31.830
You make it sound so ugly.

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:41.450
Hey! Pay a little attention
to us over here, too!

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.330
Not you, too.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:48.410
There is a world you want to
keep hidden from the children, right?

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:53.330
Let's get this taken care of quickly,
while they're getting back on track.

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:55.870
I don't enjoy seeing them in tears.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:18:00.410
You must be blind.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:11.290
Happiness is such a frightening thing.

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.080
The one who has stuck with the mansion--

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:34.660
no, with the Hoshisato family... might be me.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:45.410
Which is exactly why...

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.620
...to preserve those smiles, I have to...

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:57.330
Is this the right choice, Maeve-<i>sama</i>?

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:03.040
Mistresses, we need to talk.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:11.200
I always thought that I did not want
you to set foot into a dangerous world.

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:15.660
However, that may turn out
to have been a mistake.

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:18.580
Ema-<i>san</i>, what do you mean?

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:21.040
As long as you carry Maeve-<i>sama</i>'s blood,

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:25.000
you cannot avoid the world
that involves Artifacts.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:30.040
You should have acquired the strength
to withstand being in the center of it.

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:35.830
Allow me to ask you again.
Do you wish to help Maeve-<i>sama</i>, Mistress?

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:41.120
I want to become stronger.
I want to be able to master Muff-<i>kun</i>.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:44.580
I want to be able to prove
myself to Mama and Mariah-<i>san</i>!

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:48.040
You have the resolve. You are certain of that?

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.200
Yes!

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.120
Well then...

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:53.200
Huh? Jeeves-<i>san</i>?

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:58.410
I will drill into you the right
way to use your Artifacts.

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:01.160
Jeeves-<i>san</i>, we know you're pretty strong,

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:05.370
but if a real live person fights Muff-<i>kun</i>,
they'll get hurt, or worse.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:08.040
Please set your mind at ease, Mistress Kana.

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:15.040
I am fairly tough in my own way,
so please, do not hold back against me.

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:20.830
I see. You are concerned that I seem too frail.

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:23.910
All right, what if I were to do <i>this</i>?

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:37.830
J-Jeeves-<i>san</i>?!

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:42.370
Yes. This is my combat form.

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:48.200
This mansion is itself an Artifact,
and I am a part of it.

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:53.040
I am an Artifact, created as
a guardian for the Lároutir family.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:56.450
For many years, I have protected
Maeve-<i>sama </i>and Mariah-<i>sama</i>,

00:20:56.450 --> 00:21:01.950
to say nothing of Morrigan-<i>sama </i>and
others for many generations going back.

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:03.290
Jeeves-<i>san</i>...

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.620
You were an Artifact?

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:09.910
In the absence of the family head,
I can hold this form for 15 minutes at most.

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:12.410
However, that should be plenty.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:14.580
Wh-What do you mean?

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:19.040
Hatena!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.500
Did you not understand my meaning?

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:24.040
I can immobilize an opponent
such as yourself, Mistress Kana,

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:27.500
in no more than three seconds.

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:39.870
<i>My path now begins</i>

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:48.250
<i>I've unleashed the hidden light of one future</i>

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:54.660
<i>I've been on the hunt</i>

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:58.700
<i>to find my furthest dreams</i>

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:01.910
<i>I want to shine even brighter</i>

00:22:01.910 --> 00:22:07.000
<i>The "someday" that my former self prayed for</i>

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:12.160
<i>is still far away, but I'll catch up</i>

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:17.160
<i>"Miracle" is such an embarrassingly vague word</i>

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:22.330
<i>My timeframe has neither forever nor a moment</i>

00:22:22.330 --> 00:22:29.580
<i>I move forward one step at a time to my voice</i>

00:22:29.580 --> 00:22:33.370
<i>No matter what awaits me</i>

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:34.700
<i>beyond this pain</i>

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:36.950
<i>I'll once again, yes once again</i>

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:39.700
<i>leap up and shine</i>

00:22:39.700 --> 00:22:43.580
<i>Yeah, I'll put into words</i>

00:22:43.580 --> 00:22:45.120
<i>the view laid out before me</i>

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:48.370
<i>and let it ring out dozens,</i>

00:22:48.370 --> 00:22:52.040
<i>even hundreds of times</i>

00:22:52.040 --> 00:22:56.330
<i>What color do you suppose love is?</i>

00:22:56.330 --> 00:23:02.000
<i>I've unleashed my hidden light</i>

00:23:05.870 --> 00:23:08.290
It sounds like something has started.

00:23:08.290 --> 00:23:12.750
Perfect timing. I was
hoping to ask a favor of you.

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:14.160
A favor?

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:18.620
Please give Mistress Kana one more chance.

00:23:18.620 --> 00:23:21.330
You're asking me to test her again?

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:22.500
Yes.

00:23:22.500 --> 00:23:27.790
I need you to show the mistress
just how demanding it is

00:23:27.790 --> 00:23:31.040
to shoulder the responsibility
of protecting oneself.

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:39.000
"What is your favorite finger food?"

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:52.040
"Jeeves"

00:23:52.040 --> 00:24:01.950
"See you next time"
